OL,3,GNEWSATower block residents plagued by
OL,4,Aintruders in scaffolding 'nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe regulator said an application
OL,7,Fsubmitted in 2024 had been invalidated,
OL,8,Fwith further information required to
OL,9,Fdemonstrate compliance with building
OL,10,Fregulations.
